+// folders F45 (GitHub issue 78): a press does to each open pin what Cmd-W
+// does: it sleeps at home, a pin in its place, nested folders' too. Pins
+// already asleep stay. The folder collapses and its rows go; the tab on
+// screen, outside it, stays; the - goes, though the pointer stays.
+IN_PROC_BROWSER_TEST_F(FolderTabsTest,
+                       TheMinusSleepsTheOpenPinsAndCollapsesTheFolder) {
